{"id":"cf5d1ce9-369c-55de-923f-8da2ce92c74d","title":"在 ChatGPT 中连接 ShowAI","icon":"💬","cover":"none","parentId":"79fa3b16-d74e-58cd-81a0-2c01bd8a9499","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T20:03:21.422Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T12:10:30.688Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"在 ChatGPT 中连接 ShowAI","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"title":"在 ChatGPT 中连接 ShowAI","art":"agent","lead":"ChatGPT 网页从云端发出请求。你可以连接自己电脑上的 ShowAI，也可以使用管理员提供的托管 MCP 地址。两种方式都需要 ChatGPT 能访问的公网 HTTPS 端点。","actions":[{"label":"通用插件连接向导","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/connect-mcp","primary":true},{"label":"下载通用插件 ZIP","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/downloads/showai-universal.zip"}]},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-b7460b99"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"node-b44606e0","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"先确定内容保存在哪"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-compare","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":[{"id":"url","label":"从哪里取得地址","tone":"brand"},{"id":"storage","label":"项目和授权","tone":"teal"}],"rows":[{"label":"自己的桌面 ShowAI","values":{"url":"打开「设置 → 远程 MCP → 公网入口」，开启并检查地址。","storage":"项目直接保存在这台电脑的内容库，由你在桌面 App 批准连接。"}},{"label":"团队托管的 MCP","values":{"url":"使用运营方提供的完整 /mcp 地址。受控注册的服务可能需要注册密钥或共享项目邀请。","storage":"使用该服务对应的账号和获准项目。需要云同步时另行核对同步状态。"}}]},"integrity":"sha256-3a5b6ff02c26c6d04060377c93d47041a961d40fcd062e5944842df3976755d0"},"id":"node-chatgpt-storage"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"node-b8460d2c","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 ChatGPT 手动添加服务"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"复制真实地址","body":"复制这个入口显示的公网 HTTPS 地址，包括 /mcp。临时域名更新后，修改已有连接中的地址。"},{"title":"添加自定义 MCP 服务","body":"打开 ChatGPT Plugins，点加号 → Add custom MCP server，选择 Server URL。填入地址，选择 OAuth 和动态客户端注册（DCR），按界面提示创建并连接。"},{"title":"核对授权请求","body":"连接自己的桌面 App 时，核对客户端、连接编号和项目权限，再点允许。托管服务则在运营方的授权页登录并选择范围。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-22420cb6"}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"node-27421495"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"打开 ChatGPT 插件设置","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://chatgpt.com/plugins"}}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"node-2542116f","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"安装 Skills 与验证"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"node-23420e49"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"通用 ZIP 可在添加 MCP 之前安装。若希望将六个 Skills 明确关联到已经注册的 ChatGPT 连接，在 ShowAI 的对应公网入口选择 ChatGPT，用「导出 ChatGPT 插件」填写该连接的插件页链接，再把导出的 ShowAI Personal 包导入 ChatGPT。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"node-21420b23"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 ChatGPT 的同一连接调用 projects_list。能返回列表后再选择可写项目并保存。新建或修改页面后的原页入口与聊天里的阅读预览分别来自保存回执和阅读器。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"node-9d3efcc0","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"已有连接打不开时"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"node-9e3efe53"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"未登录或授权过期时，从原条目重新连接。没有桌面批准请求时，先看 ShowAI 是否在线、该公网入口是否开启，以及 Server URL 是否还是当前地址。工具列表过期时在宿主刷新工具，再从同一连接验证。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"node-a83f0e11"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"通用插件连接向导","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/connect-mcp"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" · "},{"type":"text","text":"在 Agent 中使用","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"}}]}]}]},"layout":{},"surfaceViews":{"root":{"initial":null,"saved":[],"readingOrder":["node-b7460b99","node-b44606e0","node-chatgpt-storage","node-b8460d2c","node-22420cb6","node-27421495","node-2542116f","node-23420e49","node-21420b23","node-9d3efcc0","node-9e3efe53","node-a83f0e11"]}},"comments":[]}